  },
  {
    "en": "“Why?”",
    "ko_bytes": 16
  },
  {
    "en": "“You could've refused me.”",
    "ko_bytes": 52
  },
  {
    "en": "“But you always do what I say.”",
    "ko_bytes": 65
  },
  {
    "en": "“Seems like you know what you're doing.”",
    "ko_bytes": 78
  },
  {
    "en": "“Isn't it nice to be able to touch me whenever you want~”",
    "ko_bytes": 93
  },
  {
    "en": "“I need to work.”",
    "ko_bytes": 10
  },
  {
    "en": "“Here we go again, using that as an excuse.”",
    "ko_bytes": 26
  },
  {
    "en": "“We agreed that it needs to be consensual, that's all—right?”",
    "ko_bytes": 86
  },
  {
    "en": "“The two times you ambushed me at night weren't consensual.”",
    "ko_bytes": 86
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh, so you were awake then.”",
    "ko_bytes": 44
  },
  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Last bite.”",
    "ko_bytes": 24
  },
  {
    "en": "“—Mmmm!”",
    "ko_bytes": 22
  },
  {
    "en": "“Haa—So delicious~”",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“You just ate Shizuku's pudding.”",
    "ko_bytes": 47
  },
  {
    "en": "“Eh? Really???”",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“Just kidding, I made a few extra for you.”",
    "ko_bytes": 69
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh—!”",
    "ko_bytes": 16
  },
  {
    "en": "“It's okay.”",
    "ko_bytes": 30
  },
  {
    "en": "“You're cute like this... and I love being silly with you.”",
    "ko_bytes": 105
  },
  {
    "en": "“Wait, wait—what are you talking about?!”",
    "ko_bytes": 48
  },
  {
    "en": "“See what I mean?”",
