  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh...”",
    "ko_bytes": 17
  },
  {
    "en": "Maybe nothing has changed after all.",
    "ko_bytes": 47
  },
  {
    "en": "Maybe this is the real Ayano.",
    "ko_bytes": 84
  },
  {
    "en": "“What are you staring at me like that for?”",
    "ko_bytes": 45
  },
  {
    "en": "“Nothing, just thinking how great it is to be here.”",
